63:Tbd9,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Do AI SEO agents actually work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"In our data, for most sites, yes. Of 1,383 sites with Search Console connected before and after joining Outrank, 75.4% had more Google clicks in their latest 28 days than in the 28 days before they started, and the median site doubled its clicks around month 7. It is not universal: 24.4% had fewer clicks, and the first three months are slow."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is an AI SEO agent?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Software that runs the SEO content loop for you instead of helping you with one step. It finds keywords your customers search, writes articles, adds images and internal links, publishes them to your CMS on a schedule, and builds backlinks. An AI writing tool drafts text when you ask; an agent keeps publishing without you."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does an AI SEO agent take to show results?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Expect impressions to move within weeks and clicks to follow over months. Across 2,119 sites, median clicks were 7% above baseline in the first 28 days, 27% in days 57â€“84 and about 2.0Ã— by days 197â€“224, roughly 7 months in."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Google penalize AI-written content?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Googleâ€™s published guidance is that it rewards helpful content however it is produced, and penalizes content made mainly to manipulate rankings. Our data is consistent with that: sites publishing AI-written articles daily grew far more often than they shrank. Quality, relevance and authority are what matter, which is why Outrank also builds backlinks instead of only writing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best AI agent for SEO and content teams?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Look for four things: it publishes directly to your CMS, it does its own keyword research, it builds authority (backlinks) rather than only text, and it can show real Search Console results from customers. Agencies like VÃ¦kster and Bright Brands use Outrank for this across client sites; judge any tool, including ours, by data like the charts on this page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why did some sites lose traffic?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The data does not tell us why for each site. When we looked closer at sites near their low point, many were already declining before they joined, and Google updates and seasonality explain others. 8.2% of the cohort lost half or more of their clicks."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I verify these numbers?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The aggregate comes from Search Console data customers connected to Outrank, so it cannot be published site by site. The customer case studies linked on this page show individual sites with their ownersâ€™ permission, and third-party Domain Rating figures from Ahrefs that anyone can check."}}]}3c:["$","section",null,{"className":"section ","id":"faq","children":[[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$63"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col items-center text-center","children":["$L64","$L65","$L66"]}],"$L67"]}]]}]
